DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260719
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260720
DTSTAMP:20251126T175014Z
CREATED:20240513T144903Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251126T175014Z
UID:10043881-1784419200-1784505599@lancasterpa.com
SUMMARY:Bridges & Brunch with Strasburg Scooter Tours
DESCRIPTION:Experience a relaxing morning ride through the back roads of Amish Country in Lancaster County\, PA. Along the way to a 19th century covered bridge\, enjoy the scenery of rolling hills\, breathtaking views\, and our Amish neighbors going about their daily routines. \nItinerary\nDuration: 1.5-2 hours Some of our past tours have included: \n\nA guided tour of one of Lancaster County’s most beautiful covered bridges\nAn opportunity for a close up of daily life in Amish Country\n$10 dining voucher to one of two of Strasburg’s favorites brunch spots\, Casey Jones’ Restaurant and Speckled Hen* \n\nAnd each trip is unique\, so you never know what we might have in store for you! \n*Unfortunately\, we regret to inform you that some of the food offerings on the tour may not be considered ‘Kosher.’ We apologize for any inconvenience.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/strasburg-scooter-tours-bridges-brunch/2026-07-19/
LOCATION:Strasburg Scooter Tours\, 246 N Decatur Street\, Strasburg\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Food & Beverage Events,Halloween,Labor Day,Memorial Day Weekend,Outdoor Activities,Strasburg, Pennsylvania,Tour
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Bridges-Brunch.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancasterpa": "https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/lancaster-city-scavenger-hunt/2026-07-19/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancasterpa
X-SOURCE:Discover Lancaster
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260719
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260720
DTSTAMP:20251008T153715Z
CREATED:20250708T131037Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251008T153715Z
UID:10045230-1784419200-1784505599@lancasterpa.com
SUMMARY:Lancaster City Scavenger Hunt
DESCRIPTION:Imagine turning the streets of Lancaster into a real-life adventure—solving puzzles\, uncovering secrets\, and winning prizes along the way!\nNow’s your chance! Introducing Lancaster’s Ultimate Scavenger Challenge\, created by Unique Lancaster Experiences—where discovery\, excitement\, and local charm come together. \n???? Your Adventure Awaits:\n???? Follow inventive clues through Lancaster’s picturesque and historic downtown\n???? Earn fun rewards as you complete challenges\n???? Discover tucked-away gardens\, arcades\, historic markets\, and more\n???? Access special discounts at participating local businesses\n⏱ Choose your pace—go head-to-head with friends or enjoy a leisurely journey \n???? What Makes It Unforgettable?\n????‍????‍????‍???? Great for everyone—couples\, families\, birthday celebrations\, team events\, or spontaneous outings\n???? Hands-On & Entertaining—history comes to life through interactive games\, not lectures\n???? Creative Challenges—snap silly photos\, solve riddles\, and compete for glory\n???? On-Call Help—first-time visitor? A friendly local guide is available if you need hints\n???? Awesome Gift Idea—for Lancaster natives and curious newcomers alike \n???? Getting Started Is Easy:\n1.Reserve your tickets—just one per player\n2.Check your email for download instructions\n3.Watch a quick briefing video to get ready\n4.Meet your team at the Welcome Center\n5.Dive into a one-of-a-kind city experience!\n???? Spots are limited—reserve yours today! Whether you’re exploring Lancaster for the first time or rediscovering its charm\, this scavenger adventure will change how you see the city! \n*** Please note that some days offer multiple start times
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/lancaster-city-scavenger-hunt/2026-07-19/
LOCATION:Unique Lancaster\, 23 N Walnut Street\, Lancaster\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Lancaster City,Tour
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/scavenger-hunt--e1751993312200.png
END:VEVENT
