SUMMARY:Time Travel Adventure at Linden Hall
DESCRIPTION:In Time Travel Adventure\, a time machine found in the depths of the Linden Hall basement will take campers back in time to a different civilization each day. Along the way\, campers will make Mesopotamian-inspired cuneiform tablets\, play the Egyptian game Senet\, “visit” Chichen Itza in Mesoamerica\, learn about important Chinese inventions\, and create mosaics in the Greco-Roman style. \nDay: July 20-24 \nOvernight: July 19-24 \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!\n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar
