SUMMARY:Evening Camp at Penn Medicine Park
DESCRIPTION:Step onto the field for an unforgettable evening of baseball. Our Evening Camp is designed for players ages 7-13 to develop their skills in a fun and exciting environment. Under the guidance of experiences coaches\, Participants will focus on the key aspects of the game including hitting\, fielding\, throwing and base running\, all while enjoying the thrill of playing in a stadium setting. \nJoin us for an exciting\, skill-building baseball camp where players of all levels will enhance their abilities in every aspect of the game! Participants will focus on key fundamentals such as hitting\, pitching\, fielding\, base running\, and throwing. Through instruction from the Stormers coaching staff and fun drills\, players will progressively build their skills and gain confidence on the field\, setting the foundation for success in competitive play. Train like the Stormers! \nRuns: 6:00 pm – 9:00 pm \n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!
