 casterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-ride-to-manheim-long-24f/)\n\nTour de Red Rose &
  LBC Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes and
  Weather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!foru
 m/lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHelmets
  are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic r
 epair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing a Meetu
 p Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lanc
 asterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is y
 our agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclu
 b.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)
  and [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx
 ?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](https://l
 ancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
