DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Summer Reading\, Children\n\nLancaster Public Library
 ’s Summer Reading Program is a community tradition that promotes reading
  for fun and lifelong enrichment. This summer\, we are offering a rich var
 iety of programs to spark curiosity\, imagination\, and learning across al
 l age groups.In collaboration with STEAM Sneakerheadz™\, we’re bringin
 g you a one-of-a-kind summer reading program that makes science and chemis
 try fun\, fresh\, and totally hands-on! Participants will create custom ti
 e-dye shoelaces while exploring the science of color through both natural 
