SUMMARY:Steam Sneakerheadz: Sneaker Deodorizer
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T163000
UID:348fe801713e501ff861bc197feb1643@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Summer Reading\, Children\n\nLancaster Public Library
 ’s Summer Reading Program is a community tradition that promotes reading
  for fun and lifelong enrichment. This summer\, we are offering a rich var
 iety of programs to spark curiosity\, imagination\, and learning across al
 l age groups.In collaboration with STEAM Sneakerheadz™\, we’re bringin
 g you a one-of-a-kind summer reading program that makes science and chemis
 try fun\, fresh\, and totally hands-on! Participants will design and custo
 mize their own sneaker deodorizer pods while exploring the science behind 
 odor control and product formulation. Through hands-on experimentation\, s
 tudents will work with ingredients such as baking soda\, activated charcoa
 l\, and fragrance oils to understand how chemistry is used to absorb odors
  and create effective products.Ages 7-12 · Registration required
LOCATION:Lancaster\, LPL Program Room A + B
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/steam-sneakerheadz-sneak
 er-deodorizer-171127
