UID:a9ac277d9c69c6714ba551f96003ee3f@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Teens\n\nBring your favorite book and give it 
 some sparkle! Teens (ages 13-18) are invited to a fun\, creative afternoon
  where you can bedazzle your own book cover using rhinestones and gems pro
 vided by the library. Whether you want a subtle shimmer or full-on glam\, 
 you can design a book that completely matches your style.Hang out with fri
 ends\, get creative\, and leave with a book that you will treasure forever
 !Note: Please bring a book that you are comfortable decorating - supplies 
 will be provided\, but books will not.Registration will open at 9:00AM on 
 Wednesday\, July 8th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and 
 on Wednesday\, July 15th for residents of other municipalities.Designated 
 Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your registra
 tion. Only children in that age range will be admitted.Cancellations- Plea
 se check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not 
 been cancelled. LIBRARY PROGRAM POLICIES:No Show – Patrons failing to ca
 ncel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will b
 e restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one mont
 h’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the
  start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notifie
 d of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 1
 0 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other
  circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At
  this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who wil
 l be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the 
 program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 
 5 minutes past the start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
