 ogram is for teens 13-19 years of age. Unwind\, craft\, and create at Teen
  Free Create! Bring your current creative project and enjoy a relaxed spac
 e to work alongside your friends. Whether you're into painting\, crochetin
 g\, sketching\, or collaging\, all skill levels and crafts are welcome. Su
 pplies for basic crafts and inspiration will be available\, but feel free 
 to bring your work-in-progress. Come hang out and share ideas with fellow 
 makers!Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 22nd for Manhe
 im Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, July 24th for resi
 dents of other municipalities.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel thei
 r registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restric
 ted from registering for future programs for a period of one month’s tim
 e. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of
  the program to allow those on the waiting list to be notified of their ch
 ange in registration status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes
  prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circ
 umstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this
  time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be 
 granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the progr
 am. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5
  minutes past the start time. Drop Off Program – This program is inten
 ded for children over the age of 13 years who can participate independentl
 y. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth services staff pr
 ior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space.  Designat
 ed Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your reg
 istration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/teen-free-create-178252
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
