BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/lancaster-science-factory-presents-coding-166995"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Lancaster Science Factory Presents Robotics with Edison
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260804T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260804T183000
UID:f0d74c8b74dd3137e9bea0141cbeea0f@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\n\nMeet Edison\, the robot you can p
 rogram with just a scan! In this hands-on robotics session\, students expl
 ore how robots respond to commands by scanning pre-programmed barcodes tha
 t instantly load instructions into Edison.🤖Students work in teams to ex
 plore Edison’s built-in features and test its behaviors in a variety of 
 real-world-inspired challenges. No devices and no downloads\, just scan\, 
 observe\, and engineer solutions.Registration for Lancaster Science Factor
 y Presents Robotics with Edison will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 22
 nd for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, Jul
 y 29th for residents of other municipalities.Ages 8-9 years of age only!De
 signated Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your
  registration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.Cancellati
 ons- Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the program
  has not been cancelled. Library Program PoliciesNo Show – Patrons faili
 ng to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a mont
 h will be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of 
 one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prio
 r to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be
  notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please 
 arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking a
 nd other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated 
 time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list
  who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed i
 nto the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the 
 program 5 minutes past the start time.Drop Off Program – This program is
  intended for children over the age of 8 years who can participate indepen
 dently. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth services sta
 ff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/lancaster-science-factor
 y-presents-coding-166995
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
