DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T110000
UID:0a894803c07d12d66c140da62f67ee11@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nBook Babies is a special time for babies
  to share stories\, songs\, rhymes and games with their grown-ups. Come pl
 ay with us in the Children’s Library! (Newborn to 17 months\, with adult
 ) Please add any additional registrants to your registration if more than 
 one child that will be participating in the program.Registration for Book 
 Babies will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 22nd for Manheim Township a
 nd East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, July 24th for residents of othe
 r municipalities.Storytime PoliciesProgram Limits - Patrons are limited to
  one session of multiple session programs per week.Cancellations- Please c
 heck your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not been
  cancelled.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for mo
 re than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering 
 for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your
  registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow
  for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registrat
 ion status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start o
 f the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program wi
 ll begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be
  forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots r
 emain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants
  will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/book-babies-am-session-1
 54743
