DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\, Adults
 \n\nGet ready to laugh and learn with the one and only Ridiculous Nicholas
 ! This high-energy\, hilarious science show is packed with wild experiment
 s\, amazing demonstrations\, and non-stop fun.Ridiculous Nicholas brings s
 cience to life with outrageous antics\, surprising facts\, and plenty of a
 udience participation. From crazy chemical reactions to mind-blowing physi
 cs tricks\, this show will keep kids (and grown-ups!) on the edge of their
  seats—and maybe rolling on the floor with laughter!It’s silly. It’s
  smart. It’s science like you’ve never seen it before. Perfect for fam
 ilies and children of all ages!*For the safety and supervision of all part
 icipants: Children under 8 years old must be accompanied by an adult throu
 ghout the program. Children ages 8 and older are welcome to attend the pro
 gram independently.  Registration for Ridiculous Nicholas Super Science Sh
 ow will open at9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 22nd for Manheim Township and Ea
 st Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 29th for residents of other 
