SUMMARY:Understanding Immigration Law: Naturalization/Becoming a Citizen
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260808T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260808T123000
UID:fb6127cad3a2b0b76b302cf3543e5744@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Discussion\, Presentation\, Adults\n\nRegistration is preferre
 d\; walk-ins will be accommodated as space allows. Best for adults and old
 er interested teens.We welcome local immigration attorney Paige Britton\, 
 who will share her professional experience working within the U.S. immigra
 tion system over several sessions\, exploring a different element each mon
 th.Learn about the pathways and possibilities for noncitizens to become U.
 S. citizens under American immigration law. Who may naturalize\, and can y
 ou pass the civics test?? This event is offered solely as information abou
 t the American legal system and should not be construed as legal advice. I
 f you need legal counsel on this or other immigration matters\, please con
 sult a qualified immigration attorney.
LOCATION:Quarryville\, QVL C.X. Carlson Cultural Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/copy-copy-understanding-
 immigration-law-naturalizationbecoming-citizen-160894
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
