SUMMARY:Unearthing History: Metal Detecting Secrets with the LRRC
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260808T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260808T130000
UID:098b5cf24b51c1259a00aae16c4bcec3@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Community\, Discussion\, Presentation\, Teens\
 , Adults\, Seniors\n\nUnearthing History: Metal Detecting Secrets with the
  LRRCHistory isn’t just found in textbooks—sometimes it’s buried rig
 ht beneath our feet. Join us for a fascinating presentation by the members
  of the Lancaster Research and Recovery Club (LRRC).These local history hu
 nters will share the thrilling stories behind their most incredible metal-
 detecting discoveries\, from forgotten relics to long-lost personal treasu
 res. Come learn about the research that guides their searches\, the techno
 logy behind the hunt\, and the fascinating local stories they’ve uncover
 ed one signal at a time.See the Finds: Members will have a display of reco
 vered artifacts on hand for you to view up close!
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Meeting Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/unearthing-history-metal
 -detecting-secrets-lrrc-191382
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
