  open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 29th for Manheim Township and East Lam
 peter residents and on Wednesday\, August 5th for residents of other munic
 ipalities.Registration Requirements – To help us manage our space\, plea
 se register every person who will be attending\, including adults or sibli
 ngs.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify th
 at the program has not been cancelled. Library Policies:No Show – Patron
 s failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in
  a month will be restricted from registering for future programs for a per
 iod of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hou
 rs prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting lis
 t to be notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – 
 Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for pa
 rking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the desi
 gnated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wa
 it list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be al
 lowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to ent
 er the program 5 minutes past the start time.Photography - The Manheim Tow
 nship Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or vid
 eo recording individuals (including children) without their consent (or in
  the case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
