 d creativity. It's a great way for community members to socialize\, learn\
 , and have fun in a supportive environment.Registration for Lego Block Par
 ty will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 29th for Manheim Township and E
 ast Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, August 5th for residents of othe
