X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Apostlesucc": "https://apostlesucc.org/event/environmental-team-meeting-6/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:apostlesucc
X-SOURCE:Church of the Apostles UCC
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T193000
DTSTAMP:20260719T002217
CREATED:20260714T142025Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260714T142038Z
UID:38437-1786645800-1786649400@apostlesucc.org
SUMMARY:Environmental Team Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The Environmental Team at Church of the Apostles is dedicated to living out our vision of environmental advocacy through meaningful\, sustainable actions. We are committed to reducing our carbon footprint\, exploring alternative energy sources\, and creating a green church through initiatives like transitioning lawns to meadows\, planting native species\, and increasing recycling efforts. We aim to reduce single-use products\, encourage composting\, and promote eco-friendly practices such as using bamboo products and glass communion cups. \nWe are also focused on education\, community partnerships\, and exploring grant opportunities to fund environmental projects. Visit apostlesucc.org/green-justice-ministry to learn more about how we are working to protect the planet and create a more sustainable future. \nTeam Leader: Mark Achtermann\nStaff Liaison: Rev. Kathryn Kuhn
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/environmental-team-meeting-6/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Lancaster Freethought Society": "https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/mgwdztyjclbrb/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_lancaster_freethought_society
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Lancaster Freethought Society
UID:event_mgwdztyjclbrb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042254Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T193000
SUMMARY:Patriarchy\, Matriarchy & Democracy: A Two-Part Online Discussion
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThis is an LFS online discussio
 n series\, held on Google Meet.\nAcross two sessions\, we’ll explore how
  patriarchy and matriarchy organize power\, care\, law\, family\, sex\, mo
 ney\, violence\, and democracy.\nWe’ll use consciousness-raising style d
 iscussion rules: speak personally\, listen carefully\, don’t interrupt\,
  and don’t debate someone while they are speaking.\nFor each question\, 
 we’ll do a speaking round first. After everyone who wants to speak has s
 poken\, Susan will offer brief evidence\, examples\, or definitions to dee
 pen the discussion.\n**Part 1**\n\n* What is patriarchy?\n* What is matria
 rchy?\n* How do these systems operate?\n\n**Part 2**\n\n* What are the ben
 efits of each?\n* What are the dangers or pitfalls of each?\n* Can democra
 cy exist inside a patriarchy?\n\nThis is not a lecture. It is a structured
  conversation about power\, equality\, family\, sex\, law\, care\, violenc
 e\, democracy\, and what kind of world we want to build.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 mgwdztyjclbrb/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260702T123740Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260702T123740Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
