DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260817T190000
UID:bcbff734b6ebd6341811ee9c5f7959e9@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Teens\n\nTeen Advisory Board presents: This pr
 ogram is for teens 13-19 years of age. Unwind\, craft\, and create at Teen
  Free Create! Bring your current creative project and enjoy a relaxed spac
 e to work alongside your friends. Whether you're into painting\, crochetin
 g\, sketching\, or collaging\, all skill levels and crafts are welcome. Su
 pplies for basic crafts and inspiration will be available\, but feel free 
 to bring your work-in-progress. Come hang out and share ideas with fellow 
 makers!Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, August 5th for Manh
 eim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, August 7th for re
 sidents of other municipalities.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel th
 eir registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restr
 icted from registering for future programs for a period of one month’s t
 ime. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start 
 of the program to allow those on the waiting list to be notified of their 
 change in registration status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minute
 s prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other cir
 cumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At thi
 s time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be
  granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the prog
 ram. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 
 5 minutes past the start time. Drop Off Program – This program is inte
 nded for children over the age of 13 years who can participate independent
 ly. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth services staff p
 rior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space.  Designa
 ted Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your re
 gistration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/teen-free-create-178254
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
