 f 2027 rising seniors! Celebrate the beginning of your senior year by crea
 ting a personalized Memory Box! You are invited to design and decorate a k
 eepsake box to hold photos\, ticket stubs\, notes\, and mementos from your
  special year. Use paint\, collage materials\, stickers\, and more to make
  this box uniquely yours while spending time with fellow seniors. All supp
 lies provided.Designated Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions 
 designated on your registration. Only teens in that age range will be admi
 tted.   No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for
  more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registeri
 ng for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel y
 our registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to al
 low those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registrati
 on status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the s
 tart of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The prog
 ram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot w
 ill be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If s
 pots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, regis
 trants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the s
 tart time.
