DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Virtual\, Everyone\n\nGet ready for an all-out showdo
 wn\, gamers!Play it Forward is hosting a retro fundraising battle as the g
 ame libraries of the PlayStation 1 and Nintendo 64 go head-to-head to see 
 which console can raise the most money for the Lancaster Public Library!Jo
 in us over two action-packed weekends—August 21–23 and August 28–30\
 , streaming noon to midnight each day—as we play over 20 classic games f
 rom these iconic consoles.🎮 PlayStation Weekend: August 21–23🎮 Nin
 tendo 64 Weekend: August 28–30You’ll also have chances to win some awe
 some nerdy prizes! We’ll be raffling off items from local organizations 
 during each game played.Be sure to follow the event page to see featured g
 ames\, prize reveals\, and more updates!📺 Watch live: https://www.twitc
 h.tv/play_it_4ward🎟️ Raffle RulesEach game during the event will have
  its own dedicated time slot\, and every time slot will feature a specific
  raffle prize.For every $1 donated\, you’ll receive one entry into that 
 time slot’s raffle. At the end of each time slot\, a winner will be rand
 omly selected for that prize.
