UID:3bd3f746a8ba6732b6fc92c285f7ecff@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/etowndems_community_A_20260621002645223380.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Elizabethtown Fair\, AUGUST 24-29\, 2026! Sign
  up to help run the ETown Dems booth - chat with fairgoers and candidates\
 , and help run a kids' activity. We are looking for people who can work at
  least one 2-hour shift between the hours of 4pm-10pm\, every day of the f
