BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/sensory-discovery-storytime-182744"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Sensory Discovery Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260825T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260825T150000
UID:dc4c021225f3dfe718a51ce14aca4436@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nJoin Ms. Laura for a fun and engaging 
 sensory discovery storytime program all about THE OCEAN! We will use our s
 enses to explore how it looks\, feels\, smells and sounds to be under the 
 sea!This program is intended for children 3-6 years old. Children should b
 e able to listen to\, comprehend and participate in emergent science\, mat
 h and literacy topics. Activities may include small parts so children shou
 ld be past the stage of mouthing items. Parents and caregivers are invited
  to participate with their children to learn how to replicate the activiti
 es at home! Sensory experiences provide children with opportunities to dev
 elop fine motor skills\, eye-hand coordination\, problem solving\, logic a
 nd concentration. They'll grow their attention spans and practice emotiona
 l regulation and mindfulness.Allergy notice: Please note sensory materials
  may contain allergens like.Ms. Laura has over 20 years of preschool class
 room experience bringing a wealth of knowledge in early childhood developm
 ent. Her approach focuses on creating a warm\, engaging\, and supportive e
 nvironment where children can thrive.Adults attending with their child(ren
 ) do NOT need to register. Please add any additional registrants to your r
 egistration if more than one child that will be participating in the progr
 am.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, August 12th for Manheim
  Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, August 15th for resi
 dents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failin
 g to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month
  will be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of o
 ne month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior
  to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be 
 notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please a
 rrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking an
 d other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated t
 ime. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list 
 who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed in
 to the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the p
 rogram 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – This program 
 is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be
  engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- P
 lease check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has n
 ot been cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center AB
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/sensory-discovery-storyt
 ime-182744
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
