  the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, September 2nd
  for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, Septembe
 r 4th for residents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – 
 Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library progr
 ams in a month will be restricted from registering for future programs for
