  to your registration if more than one child that will be participating in
  the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, September 2nd
  for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, Septembe
 r 4th for residents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – 
 Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library progr
 ams in a month will be restricted from registering for future programs for
  a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least
  2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiti
 ng list to be notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrival
 s – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow 
 for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at th
 e designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on 
 the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may
  be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted 
 to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults –
  This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to
  attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Ca
 ncellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the
  program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are limited to on
