BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/martina-mcbride-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T193000
DTSTAMP:20260520T184621Z
CREATED:20260504T133033Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260520T184621Z
UID:10001883-1790278200-1790278200@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Martina McBride
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $99 $109 $119 $139 \nMultiple Grammy® nominee Martina McBride has sold over 23 million albums to date\, which includes 20 Top 10 singles and six #1 hits. \nMartina McBride has earned more than 15 major music awards\, including four wins for Female Vocalist of the Year from the Country Music Association and won three Academy of Country Music for Top Female Vocalist. Martina has been awarded 14 Gold Records. Nine Platinum honors\, three Double Platinum Records\, and two Triple Platinum Awards. Martina was awarded the Covenant House Beacon of Hope Award and Music Business Association’s prestigious 2015 Harry Chapin Memorial Humanitarian Award for her philanthropic efforts on behalf of domestic violence. In 2019 Martina received the Cliffie Stone Icon Award at the ACM Honors event for her impactful contributions to Country Music.  Martina was honored during the 46th Annual Common Wealth Awards of Distinguished Service for her philanthropic work and contributions to society. In 2021 Martina unveiled her first exhibit in the Country Music Hall of Fame and Museum\, titled “The Power of Her Voice”. \nMartina has released two cookbooks – the first\, Around the Table\, a full-color illustrated collection of her favorite recipes\, hosting tips\, practical menu planning advice\, and themed décor inspiration. She released her second book\, Martina’s Kitchen Mix: My Recipe Playlist for Real Life\, in October 2018. Most recently Martina launched her own wine label\, Luna & Finn\, named after her beloved pets. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/martina-mcbride-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/MM_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Bird In Hand": "https://bird-in-hand.com/event/bird-in-hand-hot-air-balloon-festival/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bird_in_hand
X-SOURCE:Bird-in-Hand
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
DTSTAMP:20260423T104338Z
CREATED:20260417T160630Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260423T104338Z
UID:10001061-1790294400-1790467199@bird-in-hand.com
SUMMARY:Bird-in-Hand Hot Air Balloon Festival
DESCRIPTION:We’re taking our favorite high-flying\, family-friendly fun fall event to new heights! \nWe’re thrilled to partner with Balloon Shows USA to bring you an all-new balloon festival. Enjoy a weekend of spectacular hot air balloon glows and laser light shows\, music\, family activities\, food trucks\, craft vendors and more. \nYou’ll find lots to do in the afternoon and evening. Ascend in a tethered balloon\, weather permitting. Browse our retailers’ offerings. If you’re bringing little ones\, take a wagon ride\, visit our kids’ area\, and let them burn off some energy in the bounce houses. Grab a bite to eat from our food trucks; each will offer a special bacon-themed dish in addition to its regular menu. \nAt 8:30\, the lights come on and the fun kicks into high gear. Watch as massive tethered hot air balloons illuminate the night and state-of-the-art laser displays paint the sky with brilliant colors. It’s an unforgettable sight and an experience you won’t want to miss. \nWhat to expect: \n\nMassive balloons and special shaped balloons guaranteed to delight kids and adults alike.\nCheck your bucket list and get a ride in a real tethered balloon ($35\, weather permitting).\nHigh-energy entertainment all evening with our DJ.\nShop\, explore and discover craft and retail vendors with unique finds and handmade goods.\nSatisfy your cravings at our food truck festival\, featuring special bacon-themed creations from select vendors.\nTake in the scenery and enjoy our farm with free hayrides.\nDon’t miss the Kids Zone with games\, rides\, bounce houses and nonstop fun ($5 to $20 for unlimited rides).\nThe Grand Finale (8:30 pm nightly) with Balloon Glow & Laser Show\, music and synchronized balloon burn\, giant glowing balloons and crowd countdowns\n\nDates: Friday\, September 25\, 2026 & Saturday\, September 26\, 2026\nTime: 3 pm–10 pm both days\nGrand Finale: 8:30 pm \nTickets:  \nIn advance\nVIP: $45/day\nAdults: $25/day\nKids (6-12): $15/day\nKids (5 and under): FREE \nTickets will be available at the gate for an additional cost. \nGet tickets now before we sell out. \nClick here to order tickets \n 
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/bird-in-hand-hot-air-balloon-festival/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Event Field\, 320 North Ronks Road\, Bird-in-Hand\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026BalloonEventHeader.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
