SUMMARY:Modern Monsters: A Horror Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T200000
UID:48f0a2de180b5da4ec5a5b87501923d8@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nJoin us third Mondays of the m
 onth to dive into the most talked-about\, chilling\, and boundary-pushing 
 books in the genre today. From haunted houses with a twist to supernatural
  slashers and cultural folk horror\, we’re exploring the new classics th
 at are keeping readers up at night. Come for the scares\, stay for the sur
 vival strategies.June 15 - How to Sell a Haunted House by Grady Hendrix Ju
 ly 20 - My Heart is a Chainsaw by Stephen Grahm Jones August 17 - Bad Cree
  by Jessica Johns September 21 - We Used to Live Here by Marcus KliewerOct
 ober 19 - The Last House on Needless Street by Catriona Ward November 16 -
  The Reformatory by Tananarive Due December 21 - The Eyes are the Best Par
 t by Monika Kim
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/modern-monsters-horror-b
 ook-club-176803
