SUMMARY:Meet to review members' work in process
DESCRIPTION:Authors in the Making\nAuthors in the Making meets biweekly to
  review and critique members work in process. Join us at Saladworks at 584
  Centerville Road.\n\nDon't forget a laptop or tablet! We use Dropbox to s
 ubmit and review stories.
